<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Filatura Cervinia — Italian Yarn Manufacturing</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Filatura Cervinia — Italian yarn manufacturing since 1946, in Biella.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="header">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="#home" class="logo">FILATURA<br><span>CERVINIA</span></a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Apri menu">☰</button>
    <nav class="menu">
      <a href="#company">Company</a>
      <a href="#production">Production</a>
      <a href="#yarns">Yarns</a>
      <a href="#quality">Quality</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a href="#" class="language">IT / EN</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">ITALIAN YARN MANUFACTURING SINCE 1946</p>
    <h1>Tradition,<br><em>made modern.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-text">
      From selected fibres to finished yarns, we combine
      Italian textile heritage, technology and quality.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="#yarns" class="button button-light">Discover our yarns</a>
      <a href="#production" class="button button-outline">Our production</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="numbers">
  <div class="container numbers-grid">
    <div class="number">
      <strong>1946</strong>
      <span>Founded in Biella</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number">
      <strong>25.000+</strong>
      <span>m² covered area*</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number">
      <strong>2M+</strong>
      <span>kg production capacity*</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number">
      <strong>Global</strong>
      <span>International reach</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="company">
  <div class="container two-columns">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow dark">THE COMPANY</p>
      <h2>Made in Biella.<br>Built on experience.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="text-large">
      <p>
        Since 1946, Filatura Cervinia has developed its expertise
        in the production of quality yarns, combining tradition,
        innovation and attention to detail.
      </p>
      <p>
        Located in the heart of the Biella textile district,
        our production follows the yarn through every stage,
        from raw material preparation to the finished product.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="production" id="production">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">OUR PRODUCTION</p>
        <h2>From fibre<br>to yarn.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        A complete production process designed to maintain
        control, consistency and quality at every stage.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="process-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Raw materials</h3>
        <p>Selection and preparation of fibres.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Spinning</h3>
        <p>Transforming fibres into quality yarn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Twisting</h3>
        <p>Developing the required structure and characteristics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Winding</h3>
        <p>Preparing yarn for the following production stages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card">
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Finishing</h3>
        <p>Final treatments and quality control.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section yarns" id="yarns">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow dark">OUR YARNS</p>
        <h2>Designed for<br>creative possibilities.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        A flexible approach to yarn production for knitting,
        hand knitting and specialised applications.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="yarn-grid">
      <article class="yarn-card">
        <div class="yarn-image yarn-one"></div>
        <div class="yarn-info">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Knitting yarns</h3>
          <p>Yarns developed for contemporary knitting applications.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="yarn-card">
        <div class="yarn-image yarn-two"></div>
        <div class="yarn-info">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Special collections</h3>
          <p>Different fibres, structures and textures for distinctive results.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="yarn-card">
        <div class="yarn-image yarn-three"></div>
        <div class="yarn-info">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Custom solutions</h3>
          <p>Production possibilities adapted to specific requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="statement">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p>
    <h2>
      Tradition is not<br>
      <em>standing still.</em>
    </h2>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="quality">
  <div class="container quality-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow dark">QUALITY</p>
      <h2>Control at<br>every stage.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-large">
        Quality begins with the selection of raw materials
        and continues throughout the entire production process.
      </p>
      <div class="quality-list">
        <div>
          <strong>01</strong>
          <span>Raw material control</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>02</strong>
          <span>Production monitoring</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>03</strong>
          <span>Final quality checks</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="global">
  <div class="container global-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">FROM BIELLA TO THE WORLD</p>
    <h2>Italian know-how.<br><em>International vision.</em></h2>
    <p>
      A textile heritage rooted in Biella and connected
      to international markets.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow dark">CONTACT</p>
      <h2>Let's talk<br>about yarn.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        Discover our production capabilities and
        discuss your next project with our team.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:info@filaturacervinia.it" class="contact-link">
        info@filaturacervinia.it →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
  <div class="container footer-content">
    <div>
      <strong>FILATURA CERVINIA</strong>
      <p>Biella, Italy · Since 1946</p>
    </div>
    <p>© 2026 Filatura Cervinia — DEMO CONCEPT</p>
  </div>
</footer>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
